          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਹਲਕਾ (halkā) is a tadbhava, a word inherited from Sanskrit and reshaped by sound change. It comes from laghu, \"light\" (CDIAL 10896). Its sounds have been swapped, and a -k- added."
            }
